<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>TIU_EVSuppression</defName>
    <label>EV-Σ 억제</label>
    <description>EV-Σ 억제제 투여로 형성된 일시적 상태. 변이 진행과 환경 오염에 대한 저항을 끌어올리지만 하루 안에 효과가 소실된다.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.6, 0.9, 1.0)</defaultLabelColor>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
        <severityPerDay>-1.0</severityPerDay>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ToxicResistance>0.5</ToxicResistance>
          <ImmunityGainSpeed>0.3</ImmunityGainSpeed>
          <ToxicEnvironmentResistance>0.5</ToxicEnvironmentResistance>
        </statOffsets>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>0.05</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

</Defs>
